//! Module  :   Pointer Event Driver
//! Purpose :   Defines a global pointer-event listener that channels
//!             browser events into library-defined events for any
//!             **registered** hit areas. Certain visual components
//!             will be defined with said hit areas, providing
//!             user interaction.
//! Version :   0.2.0
//! Author  :   Alex Feterman
//! Created :   2021-02
//! Modified:   Fri 10/01/2021 09:47 AM


